</head>
<body>
    <MessageBoardLink />
  <SiteNavigation current="writings" />
  <main class="page">
    <div class="background" aria-hidden="true">
      {frames.map((src, i) => <img class:list={['background-frame', { active: i === 0 }]} src={src.src} alt="" />)}
      <div class="background-wash"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ink-mist-field" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <div class="falling-petals" aria-hidden="true">{petals.map((petal, i) => <i class={`petal petal--${i % 3}`} style={petal.style}></i>)}</div>
    <SplashCursor client:load RAINBOW_MODE={false} COLOR="#f7ecd9" SECONDARY_COLOR="#ffffff" COLOR_INTENSITY={0.16} SPLAT_RADIUS={0.26} DENSITY_DISSIPATION={1.7} VELOCITY_DISSIPATION={1.15} />

    <section class="writing-shell" aria-label="我的文字">
      <div class="reading-layout">
        <aside class="verse-heading" aria-label="云岫诗句">
          {[
            '最深程度的伤春悲秋是一种克己的英雄主义——云岫。',
            '九月的天很高远，缱绻的路也远，像这个季节里的思念向来磅礴流连——云岫。',
            '觑着月亮对坐相论，山海相隔不过眼底乾坤——云岫。',
            '其间枯荣有数，得失难量，也好在这里演一场老式的游园惊梦——云岫。',
          ].map((verse, line) => (
            <p class={`verse-line verse-line--${line + 1}`} aria-label={verse} style={`--line:${line}`}>
              {[...verse].map((char, i) => <span aria-hidden="true" style={`--i:${i};--drop-x:${(i % 3 - 1) * 7}px;--drop-rotate:${i % 2 === 0 ? -7 : 7}deg`}>{char}</span>)}
              {line === 0 && <img class="verse-signature" src="/images/home/home-bg-yin.webp" alt="云岫落款" />}
            </p>
          ))}
        </aside>

        <section class="paper-board" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="board-top"><span class="category"><b id="category-cn">诗</b><em id="category-en">POETRY</em></span><span id="counter">01 / 04</span></div>
